people who just talk  too much the power does have one glaring  weakness though  and that's that the pulse can't be used  on people who declare themselves  to be saitama's disciple now seeing as  we're on the topic of its abilities  let's take a deeper dive into its  strengths weaknesses and its  other stand power that is literally out  of this world  as far as weaknesses go sirius red is a  close range stand which means  it can never stray more than two meters  away from saitama  even though it would much rather be  doing other things most of the time  because stands can often share physical  characteristics of its user  whether it be star platinum's epic  jawline or giorno's outfit which is you  know  mirrored quite prominently by gold  experience  inside thomas case red's second weakness  is that it suffers from permanent  baldness  something which it personally blames  saitama for on the flip side though  this done mira saitama in more positive  ways as well  specifically the fact that it has no  limiter  the strength of this stand is several  times that of king crimson  or star platinum or the world or any  other stand you can think of  and it's able to perform freakish feats  of strength  other close range stands typically need  projectiles to make long range attacks  but in serious red's case his punches  are so op  that they generate shock waves that can  be felt for miles  if this stand really wanted to get  serious a flurry of punches could do  even more than this  i'm talking about like wiping out entire  countries by all accounts it is a god  level threat i mean it could  destroy humanity if it chose to do so  this stand also has  incredible speed and perception which  changes the way it views reality  remember how in part five when  butcherarti's thought process  was just so accelerated that he kind of  like perceived the world in slow motion  this is basically how serious red sees  the world but just all the time  when combining this ability with his  super speed things like bullets  swords or any other kind of sneak attack  they can all be easily neutralized with  quick precision  for fans of micro academia vigilantes  you might also recognize that the  overclock quirk is another example  of a similar power to this moving on to  this stan's most fearsome ability though  if i was to compare it to the power of a  stand that already exists  then osiris or black sabbath would  probably be most appropriate  for reasons you're about to see the one  dimension punch is a special technique  that forcibly ejects the victim's soul  from their body  and then sends it to a crudely drawn  alternate dimension  souls transported to this alternate  dimension are reincarnated as  disproportionate and poorly drawn  versions of themselves  which can lead to some horrifying  outcomes we know that humans can turn  into monsters due to their  unsatisfied desires and their feelings  and  when someone's soul enters this new  dimension for the first time  there is a big risk of monsterification  think about it for a second  if you would turn from this to this  you'd understandably be confused and  distressed  and when you combine those feelings with  your desire to transform you know back  into your normal self  this will often trigger the  monsterification process  as a result sirius red's main ability is  the potential to monstify someone's soul  in another dimension the person's body  in the main timeline  it basically just remains lifeless and  will eventually die  unless the victim somehow manages to  return the primary way they can return  is because serious red it's a sentient  stand like i said  and so it sometimes does things that  saitama doesn't want and  on occasion it may do the one dimension  punch against saitama's wishes  this leads to him freaking out because  he thinks he'll be arrested for murder  i mean you can see why you'd think that  you know it's just him standing over a  lifeless body  and no one else can actually see his  stand so it does look a bit suspicious  on those occasions red can bring souls  back to this world  through a very short ritual that just  involves all the purple orbs on his body  to start  you know glowing the only other way for  a soul to return  is if it can beat the original saitama  in this  alternate dimension but so far that has  never been done  in terms of appearance sirius red is a  muscular humanoid stand  with built-in armor that is detachable  and it also has a heroic cape as well  his design was inspired by frieza from  dragon ball z  due to the fact that frieza was a  uniquely powerful mutant  even within his own species when sirius  red delivers a flurry of punches  it's stan cry is okay okay okay okay  okay which is uh  said in the same style as uh star  platinum's auras  he has similar robotic eyes to kakuwin's  hierophant green  and you know while these eyes are never  stated to have special abilities  i'm just gonna say that they can allow  him to zoom in on things that are miles  away because  why not but with that my friends we have  fully explained the glory of saitama  stand  let me know what you think in the  comments below and make sure you sub  for more one punch man content sometimes  i will also be doing jojo's bizarre  adventure videos  as well so keep an eye out for that  until the next one  peace out
 

